"The path to the FPing binary file which provides for a more precise ping "
"command."
msgstr ""
"Sökvägen till den binära FPing-filen som ger ett mer exakt ping-kommando."

#: include/global_settings.php:244
msgid "Cacti Log Path"
msgstr "Cactis loggsökväg"

#: include/global_settings.php:245
msgid ""
"The path to your Cacti log file (if blank, defaults to &lt;path_cacti&gt;/"
"log/cacti.log)"
msgstr ""
"Sökvägen till din Cacti-loggfil (om den är tom är standardvärdet "
"&lt;path_cacti&gt;/log/cacti.log)"

#: include/global_settings.php:254
msgid "Poller Standard Error Log Path"
msgstr "Poller Standard Fel Loggsökväg"

#: include/global_settings.php:255
msgid ""
"If you are having issues with Cacti's Data Collectors, set this file path "
"and the Data Collectors standard error will be redirected to this file"
msgstr ""
"Om du har problem med Cactis datainsamlare kan du ange den här filvägen så "
"kommer standardfelet i datainsamlaren att omdirigeras till den här filen"

#: include/global_settings.php:264
msgid "Boost Debug Log"
msgstr "Boost felsökningslogg"

#: include/global_settings.php:265
msgid ""
"This is the Log file where Boost will write its information to.  It much be "
"located in the same directory as the Cacti Log file."
msgstr ""
"Detta är loggfilen där Boost kommer att skriva sin information.  Den bör "
"ligga i samma katalog som Cacti-loggfilen."

#: include/global_settings.php:272
msgid "Alternate Poller Path"
msgstr "Alternativ Poller-väg"

#: include/global_settings.php:277
msgid "Spine Binary File Location"
msgstr "Plats för binärfilen för Spine"

#: include/global_settings.php:278
msgid "The path to Spine binary."
msgstr "Vägen till Spine binary."

#: include/global_settings.php:285
msgid "Spine Config File Path"
msgstr "Spine Config Filväg"

#: include/global_settings.php:286
msgid ""
"The path to Spine configuration file.  By default, in the cwd of Spine, or /"
"etc if not specified."
msgstr ""
"Sökvägen till konfigurationsfilen för Spine.  Som standard i cwd för Spine, "
"eller /etc om den inte anges."

#: include/global_settings.php:298
msgid "RRDfile Auto Clean"
msgstr "RRDfile Auto Clean"

#: include/global_settings.php:299
msgid ""
"Automatically archive or delete RRDfiles when their corresponding Data "
"Sources are removed from Cacti"
msgstr ""
"Arkivera eller ta bort RRD-filer automatiskt när deras motsvarande "
"datakällor tas bort från Cacti"

#: include/global_settings.php:304
msgid "RRDfile Auto Clean Method"
msgstr "RRDfile Auto Clean Metod"

#: include/global_settings.php:305
msgid ""
"The method used to Clean RRDfiles from Cacti after their Data Sources are "
"deleted."
msgstr ""
"Den metod som används för att rensa RRD-filer från Cacti efter att deras "
"datakällor har tagits bort."

#: include/global_settings.php:314
msgid "Archive directory"
msgstr "Arkivkatalog"

#: include/global_settings.php:315
msgid ""
"This is the directory where RRDfiles are <strong>moved</strong> for archiving"
msgstr ""
"Detta är den katalog där RRD-filerna <strong>flyttas</strong> för arkivering"

#: include/global_settings.php:324
msgid "Log Settings"
msgstr "Logginställningar"

#: include/global_settings.php:329
msgid "Log Destination"
msgstr "Loggens destination"

#: include/global_settings.php:330
msgid "How will Cacti handle event logging."
msgstr "Hur kommer Cacti att hantera händelseloggning."

#: include/global_settings.php:336
msgid "Log Actions"
msgstr "Loggåtgärder"

#: include/global_settings.php:337
msgid ""
"What Log Actions do you wish to provide to the Cacti Administrator.  You can "
"grant either purge, rotate, or both purge and rotate.  Base files can be "
"both purged and rotated, and already rotated files can only be purged if you "
"grant that permission."
msgstr "Vilka loggåtgärder vill du ge Cacti-administratören? Du kan ge behörighet att antingen rensa, rotera eller både rensa och rotera. Grundfiler kan både rensas och roteras, men redan roterade filer kan bara rensas om du ger den behörigheten."

#: include/global_settings.php:343
msgid "Generic Log Level"
msgstr "Generisk loggnivå"

#: include/global_settings.php:344
msgid ""
"What level of detail do you want sent to the log file.  WARNING: Leaving in "
"any other status than NONE or LOW can exhaust your disk space rapidly."
msgstr ""
"Vilken detaljnivå vill du att loggfilen ska ha?  VARNING: Om du lämnar någon "
"annan status än NONE eller LOW kan diskutrymmet snabbt förbrukas."

#: include/global_settings.php:350
msgid "Expand log details"
msgstr "Expandera loggdetaljer"

#: include/global_settings.php:351
msgid ""
"What level of expansion do you want on the log file? Increase expansion can "
"slow search results"
msgstr ""
"Vilken nivå av expansion vill du ha på loggfilen? Öka expansionen kan göra "
"sökresultaten långsammare"

#: include/global_settings.php:357
msgid "Log Input Validation Issues"
msgstr "Problem med validering av logginmatning"

#: include/global_settings.php:358
msgid ""
"Record when request fields are accessed without going through proper input "
"validation"
msgstr ""
"Registrera när fält för begäran öppnas utan att ha genomgått korrekt "
"validering av inmatning"

#: include/global_settings.php:364
msgid "Data Source Tracing"
msgstr "Spårning av datakälla"

#: include/global_settings.php:365
msgid ""
"A developer only option to trace the creation of Data Sources mainly around "
"checks for uniqueness"
msgstr ""
"Ett alternativ som endast är tillgängligt för utvecklare för att spåra "
"skapandet av datakällor, främst genom kontroller av unikhet"

#: include/global_settings.php:370
msgid "Log Ignored General Errors"
msgstr "Log Ignorerade allmänna fel"

#: include/global_settings.php:371
msgid ""
"Cacti will mask certain errors that are often times considered fatal and "
"that would otherwise disable plugins and additionally confuse some users.  "
"If you wish to see these errors instead, check the checkbox."
msgstr ""
"Cacti kommer att maskera vissa fel som ofta anses vara fatala och som annars "
"skulle inaktivera insticksmoduler och dessutom förvirra vissa användare.  Om "
"du vill se dessa fel i stället markerar du kryssrutan."

#: include/global_settings.php:376
msgid "Selective File Debug"
msgstr "Selektiv felsökning av filer"

#: include/global_settings.php:377
msgid ""
"Select which files you wish to place in Debug mode regardless of the Generic "
"Log Level setting.  Any files selected will be treated as they are in Debug "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"Välj vilka filer som du vill placera i felsökningsläge oavsett inställningen "
"för den generiska loggnivån.  Alla filer som väljs kommer att behandlas som "
"om de vore i felsökningsläge."

#: include/global_settings.php:383
msgid "Selective Plugin Debug"
msgstr "Felsökning av selektivt insticksmodul"

#: include/global_settings.php:384
msgid ""
"Select which Plugins you wish to place in Debug mode regardless of the "
"Generic Log Level setting.  Any files used by this plugin will be treated as "
"they are in Debug mode."
msgstr ""
"Välj vilka insticksprogram du vill placera i felsökningsläge oavsett "
"inställningen för den generiska loggnivån.  Alla filer som används av detta "
"insticksmodul kommer att behandlas som om de vore i felsökningsläge."

#: include/global_settings.php:390
msgid "Selective Device Debug"
msgstr "Selektiv enhetsfelsökning"

#: include/global_settings.php:391
msgid ""
"A comma delimited list of Device ID's that you wish to be in Debug mode "
"during data collection.  This Debug level is only in place during the Cacti "
"polling process."
msgstr ""
"En kommaseparerad lista över enhets-ID:n som du vill ska vara i Debug-läge "
"under datainsamlingen.  Denna Debug-nivå gäller endast under Cactis "
"pollingprocess."

#: include/global_settings.php:398
msgid "Syslog/Eventlog Item Selection"
msgstr "Val av objekt för Syslog/Eventlog"

#: include/global_settings.php:399
msgid ""
"When using Syslog/Eventlog for logging, the Cacti log messages that will be "
"forwarded to the Syslog/Eventlog."
msgstr ""
"När du använder Syslog/Eventlog för loggning, de Cacti-loggmeddelanden som "
"ska vidarebefordras till Syslog/Eventlog."

#: include/global_settings.php:404
msgid "Statistics"
msgstr "Statistik"

#: include/global_settings.php:408 lib/clog_webapi.php:625
msgid "Warnings"
msgstr "Varningar"

#: include/global_settings.php:418
msgid "Log Rotation"
msgstr "Loggrotation"

#: include/global_settings.php:423 lib/clog_webapi.php:757
msgid "Rotate the Cacti Log"
msgstr "Rotera Cacti-loggen"

#: include/global_settings.php:424
msgid "This option will rotate the Cacti Log periodically."
msgstr "Detta alternativ roterar Cacti-loggen med jämna mellanrum."

#: include/global_settings.php:429
msgid "Rotation Frequency"
msgstr "Rotationsfrekvens"

#: include/global_settings.php:430
msgid "At what frequency would you like to rotate your logs?"
msgstr "Med vilken frekvens vill du rotera dina stockar?"

#: include/global_settings.php:436
msgid "Log Retention"
msgstr "Bevarande av loggar"

#: include/global_settings.php:437
msgid ""
"How many log files do you wish to retain?  Use 0 to never remove any logs. "
"(0-365)"
msgstr ""
"Hur många loggfiler vill du behålla?  Använd 0 om du aldrig vill ta bort "
"några loggar. (0-365)"

#: include/global_settings.php:447
msgid "Internationalization (i18n)"
msgstr "Internationalisering (i18n)"

#: include/global_settings.php:452
msgid "Language Support"
msgstr "Språkstöd"

#: include/global_settings.php:453
msgid ""
"Choose 'enabled' to allow the localization of Cacti. The strict mode "
"requires that the requested language will also be supported by all plugins "
"being installed at your system. If that's not the fact everything will be "
"displayed in English."
msgstr ""
"Välj \"enabled\" för att tillåta lokalisering av Cacti. Det strikta läget "
"kräver att det begärda språket också stöds av alla insticksmoduler som "
"installeras på ditt system. Om så inte är fallet kommer allt att visas på "
"engelska."

#: include/global_settings.php:459
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Språk"

#: include/global_settings.php:460
msgid "Default language for this system."
msgstr "Standardspråk för detta system."

#: include/global_settings.php:466
msgid "Auto Language Detection"
msgstr "Automatisk språkdetektering"

#: include/global_settings.php:467
msgid ""
"Allow to automatically determine the 'default' language of the user and "
"provide it at login time if that language is supported by Cacti. If "
"disabled, the default language will be in force until the user elects "
"another language."
msgstr ""
"Gör det möjligt att automatiskt fastställa användarens \"standardspråk\" och "
"ange det vid inloggning om språket stöds av Cacti. Om funktionen inaktiveras "
"kommer standardspråket att gälla tills användaren väljer ett annat språk."

#: include/global_settings.php:476
msgid "Preferred Language Processor"
msgstr "Rekommenderad språkprocessor"

#: include/global_settings.php:477
msgid ""
"Cacti includes support for multiple alternate Language Translation "
"Processors.  If none is selected Cacti will attempt to use the first one "
"found."
msgstr ""
"Cacti har stöd för flera alternativa språköversättningsprocessorer.  Om "
"ingen väljs kommer Cacti att försöka använda den första som hittas."

#: include/global_settings.php:483
msgid "Client TimeZone Support"
msgstr "Stöd för tidszoner för klienter"

#: include/global_settings.php:484
msgid ""
"How should Cacti support Client Dates based upon the Client browsers "
"timezone."
msgstr ""
"Hur ska Cacti stödja klientdatum baserat på klientens webbläsares tidszon."

#: include/global_settings.php:493 include/global_settings.php:3093
msgid "Date Display Format"
msgstr "Format för datumvisning"

