#: user_domains.php:467
msgid "Search Base"
msgstr "Sök bas"

#: user_domains.php:468
msgid ""
"Search base for searching the LDAP directory, such as "
"<i>\"dc=win2kdomain,dc=local\"</i> or <i>\"ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</"
"i>."
msgstr ""
"Sökbas för sökning i LDAP-katalogen, t.ex. <i>\"dc=win2kdomain,dc=local</i> "
"\" eller <i>\"ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local</i>\"."

#: user_domains.php:474
msgid "Search Filter"
msgstr "Sökfilter"

#: user_domains.php:475
msgid ""
"Search filter to use to locate the user in the LDAP directory, such as for "
"windows: <i>\"(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)"
"(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))\"</i> or for OpenLDAP: "
"<i>\"(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))\"</i>.  "
"\"&lt;username&gt\" is replaced with the username that was supplied at the "
"login prompt."
msgstr ""
"Sökfilter som ska användas för att hitta användaren i LDAP-katalogen, t.ex. "
"för Windows: <i>\"(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)"
"(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*</i> ))\" eller för OpenLDAP: <i>\"(&amp;"
"(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;användarnamn&amp;gt)</i>)\".  "
"\"&lt;användarnamn&amp;gt\" ersätts med det användarnamn som angavs vid "
"inloggningsprompten."

